control: The tokens issued inside any one-second window sum to at most the hard cap, and over a longer window stay within the hard cap plus the target times its length, while the stored state is kept whole and current, and the clock does not step forward
removes: the bucket holds two seconds' worth at the hard cap rather than one
packages: ./ratelimit/core
tests: TestNoRunIssuesPastTheHardCap TestIssue
scheduled-count: no

